        {
            "id": "61c553cc-26f1-4164-aa38-6f2efe6483a4",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4036",
            "content": {
                "en": "They’re talking about those things again.",
                "zh": "“他们又在说那些事。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -514.3999633789063,
            "positionY": 301.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "994e8b93-3221-46a0-a7f2-52e9ad3100df",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4037",
            "content": {
                "en": "XiMu’s ritual, the troupe’s rules, and ‘the chosen one'.",
                "zh": "喜母的仪式，戏团的规矩，还有‘被选中的人’。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -167.1999969482422,
            "positionY": 301.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7f2b623c-027d-483c-b002-e37ae06e2596",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4038",
            "content": {
                "en": "I don’t understand.",
                "zh": "我不明白，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 165.59999084472657,
            "positionY": 301.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "088c0de4-cbcd-4b29-a61d-18b217f314a1",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4039",
            "content": {
                "en": "How can they talk about these things so calmly?",
                "zh": "为什么他们可以那样平静地谈论这些。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 546.4000244140625,
            "positionY": 301.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a4f3ea9d-5a92-4265-9f7b-ee6ac4f34cdc",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4040",
            "content": {
                "en": "As if, so long as it is done in XiMu’s name,",
                "zh": "好像只要打着供奉喜母的名义，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 936.7999877929688,
            "positionY": 300.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "118dd0bb-5e96-440a-b432-bf9fb3f06487",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4041",
            "content": {
                "en": "no matter how strange or how terrible it is,",
                "zh": "再奇怪、再可怕的事，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1291.199951171875,
            "positionY": 300.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bb21aabb-199b-478b-aa79-250123386e3e",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4042",
            "content": {
                "en": "it all becomes perfectly justified.",
                "zh": "也都能变得理所当然。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1641.5999755859375,
            "positionY": 300.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7f227f2b-035d-4b59-9305-fede05feb3a0",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4043",
            "content": {
                "en": "They say I’ll understand someday.",
                "zh": "他们说我以后会懂。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2003.199951171875,
            "positionY": 300.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "798ca0bf-e727-425e-835f-d2acae0d5c74",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4044",
            "content": {
                "en": "They say this is something every member of the Shen family has to learn sooner or later.",
                "zh": "说这是沈家人迟早都要学会的东西。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2348.0,
            "positionY": 300.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "13575e98-d9c9-46ab-aceb-af8318babc0f",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4045",
            "content": {
                "en": "...But at least right now,",
                "zh": "……可至少现在的我，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2697.599853515625,
            "positionY": 300.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0f247e66-f33e-4dd0-80d5-d1d1ecff124d",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4046",
            "content": {
                "en": "I still can’t see any of this the way they do.",
                "zh": "还是没办法像他们那样看待这一切。”",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3066.39990234375,
            "positionY": 300.79998779296877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
